THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
===================

Yukumo is an original, standalone Lavalink v4 client. It does not bundle,
import, or depend on any third-party Lavalink wrapper at runtime — its only
runtime dependency is `ws`.

During development, portions of Yukumo's design (protocol handling, node
selection heuristics, filter presets, and event conventions) were informed by
the following MIT-licensed open-source projects. Where any code was
